  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock id="HH1C967D5CB7055C23C61684D3A8ADDA65" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock id="HH3753C2D0F64441EEC1CB77241E2239DC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="HH2FB9527C1D4BB25D79F1C0C76F5BC95D" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock id="HHDB4E63D65FD21AE5462A8FBA840EA717" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="HHEBA1CD44839C108D1DAFD6DE3427BE45" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="HH22FBAEA0509E80B804A4341B1670898A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;On July 18, 2018, in Docket No. PL17-1-001, the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (&amp;#8220;Commission&amp;#8221;) dismissed the requests for rehearing and clarification of its revised policy statement on treatment of income taxes (&amp;#8220;Revised Policy Statement&amp;#8221;) and provided guidance regarding the treatment of ADIT in light of its revised policy. &lt;em&gt;Inquiry Regarding the Commission&amp;#8217;s Policy for Recovery of Income Tax Costs&lt;/em&gt;, Order on Rehearing of Revised Policy Statement, 164 FERC &amp;#182; 61,030 (Jul. 18, 2018) (&amp;#8220;July 18 Order&amp;#8221;). Pursuant to the guidance provided by the Commission in its July 18 Order, Gulfstream Natural Gas System, L.L.C., a tax pass-through entity owned in part by Spectra Energy Partners, LP, a master limited partnership, intends to remove any balances recorded in Accounts 190, 281, 282, and 283 of the Commission&amp;#8217;s Uniform System of Accounts, as well as excess ADIT that has been transferred to Account 254 and deficient ADIT that has been transferred to Account 182.3. Gulfstream Natural Gas System, L.L.C. has requested approval from the Chief Accountant of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission to implement the accounting entries necessary for removing these balances. Upon receipt of the Chief Accountant&amp;#8217;s approval, Gulfstream Natural Gas System, L.L.C. will reflect the removal of these balances in the annual and quarterly financing reporting required by Part 260 of the Commission&amp;#8217;s regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="HH582A4E700260C05D782FA2D6F218758A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock id="HHE60759687E403C6B3DE58B8464A791E0" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Gulfstream Natural Gas System, L.L.C. is managed by a Management Committee.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Removal, effective 01/29/2026&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Wolfe, Jeffrey J., Representative, Enbridge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Paglia, Richard M., Alternate Representative, Enbridge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Appointment, effective 01/29/2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; margin: 0in .5in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;Knight-Turcan, Kurt, Representative, Enbridge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; margin: 0in .5in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;Huffman, Robert L., Alternate Representative, Enbridge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="HHD790CCB2EDB33AB49E3957CEAFD4E7D7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;" align="center"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTES TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;" align="center"&gt;For the Three Months Ended March 31, 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;These interim financial statements should be read in conjunction with the financial statements and notes thereto contained in the Form 2 of Gulfstream Natural Gas System, L.L.C. (Gulfstream), for the year ended December 31, 2025. These financial statements are unaudited, but in management&amp;#8217;s opinion, reflect all normal recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of financial position, results of operations and cash flows for the period presented. The results as presented for this interim period are not necessarily indicative of results to be achieved for the full year. Certain information and notes which would substantially duplicate the disclosures contained in the most recent FERC Form 2 have been omitted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Previous Form 2 disclosures indicated all system balancing gas was recorded under the inventory method, however, the Company has been consistently using the fixed asset method as defined in FERC Order 581 and will disclose appropriately in the 2025 Form 2. There are no impacts to our current or historical financial statements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HH26F298D96F05ADD051F0C74B218AC0A3" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
